<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">- Kwele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Hosea chosimulila ugima wa Hosea na malaguso yake ya chilotezi. Hosea 1:1 yolonga kuwa kalotela lusita lwa utawala wa wafalume wane wa Yuda na utawala wa mfalume imwe wa Isilaili. Kandusa kulotela mwaka 750 KK (ing'hali Chilisito). Haimanyika kuwa Hosea kandika mwenyewo ulotezi wake muna ichitabu chino hebu kandika munhu imwenga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hosea kalawa muna uufalume wa kasikazi wa Isilaili, usenga wake mwingi wa ulotezi uulunga ufalume uwo. Mulungu kamulongela Hosea yamsole mwanamke malaya yatangigwe Gomeli (sula ya 1:2). Wakala na wana watatu, mbali Gomeli kamuleka Hosea kahita kuibandama na mulume imwenga. Baho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Hosea yagendelele kumulonda ingawa katenda ugoni (sula ya 3:1). Kaye yawo ikala chilaguso cha umbwiya wa Mulungu na Waisilaili. Ingawa Waisilaili wamuleka Mulungu kwa kutambikila nyang'hiti, Mulungu kagendelela kuwalonda Waisilaili kwa waminika na keka chilagano cha kuwakombola wanhu wa isi iyo. Ulotezi wa Hosea ulonga ng'hani waminika na unovu na ulondo wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1-3 zolonga ugima wa Hosea na viyamsolile Gomeli.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 4-14 zolonga Waisilaili viwapuwile waminika na ulondo wa Mulungu wa kufunya umoyo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Hosea mwana wa Beeli muna zisiku za utawala wa Uzia na utawala wa Yosamu na utawala wa Ahazi na utawala wa Hezekia viwakalile wafalume wa Yuda. Iviya lusita lwa utawala wa Yeloboamu mwana wa Yehoashi mfalume wa Isilaili.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hosea komsola Gomeli na wokweleka wana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Mndewa Mulungu viyanduse kulonga na Hosea, kamulongela, “Hita ukasole muke wa ugoni na weleke nayo wana wa ugoni, kwaviya wanhu wa isi ino wotenda ugoni ng'hani na hawanigesa.” <verse eid="HOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Ivo kahita kumsola Gomeli mwana wa Dibilaimu. Maabaho Gomeli kapata wimo na keleka mwana wa chilume.<verse eid="HOS 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Hosea, “Mwing'he zina Yezileeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yezileeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina dino kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake Mulungu kezahanda. Mwana wa Hosea katangigwa Yezileeli kwa ichimu cha mbuli zilawilile kuna dibawe da Yezileeli.</char></note>”, kwaviya lung'hali lusita luguhi nizawatagusa welesi wa Yehu kwa ukomaji uyatendile muna dibawe da Yezileeli. Nizaukomeleza ufalume wa Isilaili. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />Siku iyo nizasegeza nguvu za watowang'hondo wa Waisilaili kuna dibawe da Yezileeli.<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Gomeli kapata wimo kaidi na keleka mwana wa chike. Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Hosea, “Mwing'he zina Lo Luhama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo Luhama </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina dino kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake sizawawonela ubazi.</char></note>, kwaviya sizawawonela ubazi kaidi Waisilaili na sizawalekelela. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Mbali nizawawonela ubazi wanhu wa Yuda na kuwakombola na kuwalopola. Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo nizawakombola, mbali siyo kwa mhinde na misale hebu zele hebu ng'hondo hebu falasi hebu wakwelafalasi.”<verse eid="HOS 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Gomeli viyamulekeze tombo Lo Luhama, kapata wimo na keleka mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Iyo mtange Lo Ami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo Ami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina dino kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake mweye siyo wanhu wangu.</char></note>”, kwaviya mweye siyo wanhu wangu na niye siyo Mulungu wenu.<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />Mbali peta ya Waisilaili izakuwa ng'hulu fana msanga wa bahali, hawadaha kupeteka hebu kulingigwa. Hanhu hawalongeligwe, “Mweye siyo wanhu wangu,” wawo wezatangigwa “Wana wa Mulungu yeli mgima.” <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />Wanhu wa Yuda na wanhu wa Isilaili wezailumba kaidi, wawo wezamsagula mtawala imwe na wezakala goya muna iisi, kwaviya siku ya Yezileeli izakuwa ng'hulu ng'hani.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />Maabaho watangeni sekulu zenu, “Wanhu wangu,” na lumbu zenu, “Wanhu wowoneligwa ubazi.”<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya Isilaili yolinganyizigwa na mwanamke mzinzi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />Mbwakileni mami yenu, mbwakileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">kwaviya yeye siyo muke wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">na niye siyo mulumake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">mulongeni yasegele na ugoni wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:2">iviya sekeyabwelele kutenda ugoni.<verse eid="HOS 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />One hatendile ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">nizamuhambula mawalo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">nizamuleka ukengele fana viyavumbuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">na nizamtenda yawe fana bwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">na nizambweleza kuna iisi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:3">na nizamkoma na ng'hilu.<verse eid="HOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Sizawawonela ubazi wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:4">kwaviya wana wa ugoni.<verse eid="HOS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Mami yawo katenda ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">yasolile inda katenda mbuli za chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">Gomeli kalonga, “Nizailumba na walume zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">waja woning'ha ndiya na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:5">sufu na chitani na mavuta na divai.”<verse eid="HOS 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />Kwa ichimu icho nizakwika miwa fana ng'huta muna inzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:6">nizamzengela mhongono muladi sekeyadahe kusulupuka.<verse eid="HOS 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />Gomeli kezawasondelela walume zake mbali hezawapata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">kezawazahila mbali hezawawona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">Maabaho kezalonga, “Nizambwelela mulumangu wa ichanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:7">kwaviya nikala goya kufosa sambi.”<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />Gomeli havimanyile kuwa niye nimwing'ha ndiya na divai na mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:8">na nimwing'ha hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:8">voyavisang'hanile kwa mulungu Baali.<verse eid="HOS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />Ivo lusita lwa kugobola nizaisola ngano yangu na divai yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:9">nizamuhoka mawalo yangu ya sufu na mawalo yangu ya chitani yonimwing'hile yaigubike.<verse eid="HOS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />Nizamguma chinyala haulongozi ha wanhu woyatendile nawo ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:10">na habule munhu yodaha kunikimilila.<verse eid="HOS 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Nizayatenda madugila yake ya dini sekeyagendelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:11">madugila yoyotenda chila mwaka na chila mwezi ukwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:11">na muna zisiku za mhumulo.<verse eid="HOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />Nizainanga mizabibu yake na minhini yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">iyalongile kuwa niiyo sang'hano yake iyeng'higwe na wanhu womulonda yakala maliho yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">nizaitenda mizabibu yake na minhini yake kuwa mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:12">na wanyama wa kumbago wezaija.<verse eid="HOS 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Nizamtagusa kwa siku zoyawatambikile Mabaali na kuwasomela ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">kaihamba kwa mhete zake za hela nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">na kawahitila walume zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:13">kanizimiza niye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowawonela ubazi wanhu wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />Lelo nizamsongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:14">nizamulongoza mbaka kudibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:14">na kulonga nayo kwa uhole.<verse eid="HOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />Uko nizambwelezela migunda yake ya mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">niye nizaditenda bawe da Magayo kuwa lwivi lwa uhuwilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">uko kezakwimba fana viyatendile viyakalile mhambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:15">fana muna isiku iyalawile Misili.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Siku iyo kwizanitanga, ‘Mulumangu’, hwizanitanga kaidi ‘Mwenevale wangu.’ ”<verse eid="HOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Nizayasegeza mazina ya Mabaali muna umulomo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:17">na hawezatambuligwa mazina yawo kaidi.<verse eid="HOS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />Siku iyo nizatenda lagano na wanyama wose wa kumbago na ndege wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:18">na wang'onyo wotambala hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:18">muladi sekewawanange wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:18">Nizasegeza mhinde zawo na mazele yawo na ng'hondo muna iisi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:18">nizawatenda wagone vinogile.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />Nizakusola uwe muke wangu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:19">nizakufungila zengele voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:19">kwa haki na kwa unovu na kwa ubazi na kwa ulondo wa kufunyaumoyo.<verse eid="HOS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Nizakufungila zengele kwa uwaminika na kwizanimanya niye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:21">“Siku iyo nizakwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:21">nizakwidika kwa ulanga na isi.<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />Isi izakwidika kwa ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:22">divai ya sambi na mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:22">vizakwidika kwa Yezileeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zina dino kwa Chiebulaniya fambulo jake Mulungu kezahanda. Mwana wa Hosea katangigwa Yezileeli kwa ichimu cha mbuli zilawilile kuna dibawe da Yezileeli.</char></note>, yani Mulungu kohanda.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />Nizamuhanda muna iisi kwa ichimu changu mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">na nizamuwonela ubazi ija Lo Luhama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">Nizamulongela ija Lo Ami, ‘Weye munhu wangu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 2:23">nayo kezalonga, ‘Weye Mulungu wangu.’ ”<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Hosea kolagusa ulondo wa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Hita ukamulaguse muke wako kuwa komulonda, ingawa katenda ugoni na mulume imwenga, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyowalonda Waisilaili ingawa watambikila milungu imwenga na walonda kulava nhosa za chibugulu cha zabibu zinyalile zikigwe hakwe.”<verse eid="HOS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Ivo nimgulila muke iyo vihande longo na vitano va hela na chilo gana na malongo matano za mhule.<verse eid="HOS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Maabaho nimulongela, “Kolondeka ukale na niye kwa siku nyingi bila kutenda ugoni hebu kuwa muke wa munhu imwenga na niye nizakuwa mwaminika.”<verse eid="HOS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Ivo Waisilaili wezakala siku nyingi bila mfalume hebu mulangulizi hebu nhambiko hebu mhanda za kutambikila hebu mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo hebu nyang'hiti za milungu.<verse eid="HOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Hamwande Waisilaili wezabwela na kumzahila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo na kumzahila mfalume wawo wa kulawa muna uwelesi wa Daudi. Wezakwiza wogudemeka kwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo, iviya wezatemeligwa mate muna ulusita lwa uhelelo.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowalonga Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Mweye Waisilaili, tegelezeni mbuli za Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:1">Mndewa Mulungu kowalonga wanhu wokala muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:1">Habule kaidi uwaminika hebu ulondo wa kufunya umoyo muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:1">habule munhu yommanya Mulungu muna iisi ino.<verse eid="HOS 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Habule mbuli imwenga ila kuduwila na uvwizi na ukomaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:2">ubavi na ugoni ulibule mhaka na kukoma wanhu.<verse eid="HOS 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Ivo isi yose yonyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:3">na wakaya wake wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:3">hamwe na wanyama wa kumbago na ndege wa kuulanga, mbaka somba wa muibahali wodanganika.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />Mbali wanhu sekewailonge na sekewaikalikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:4">kwaviya wanhu wako walinga fana wanhu wowalonga wakulu wa nhambiko.<verse eid="HOS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Weye kwizaikwala imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:5">mulotezi wa uvwizi kezaikwala hamwe na weye ichilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:5">Nizawananga wanhu wako Waisilaili.<verse eid="HOS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />Wanhu wangu wanangigwa kwaviya hawavimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:6">kwaviya weye kulema kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:6">na niye nokulema sekeuwe mkulu wa nhambiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:6">Kwaviya kuzimiza malagilizo ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:6">niye iviya nizawazimiza wanago.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Wakulu wa nhambiko viwongezeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:7">niivo viwaiyohile kunihasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:7">lelo nizahindula hishima zawo kuwa chinyala.<verse eid="HOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Woigutiza kwa nhambiko za wanhu wangu weli na uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:8">wodeng'helela wanhu viwotenda uhasanyi.<verse eid="HOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Wanhu wezakuwa fana wakulu wa nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:9">nizawatagusa kwa ichimu cha ugenzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:9">nizawaliha kwa sang'hano zawo.<verse eid="HOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />Wezakuja, mbali hawezakwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:10">wezaibandama fana malaya, mbali hawezapata wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:10">kwaviya wanileka niye Mndewa Mulungu na watambikila milungu imwenga.<verse eid="HOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu koziduwila nhambiko za milungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />Ugoni na divai ya sambi vomtenda munhu sekeyavimanye.<verse eid="HOS 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />Wanhu wangu wolonda kutazigwa na nyang'hiti ya biki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:12">nyang'hiti yawo ya biki yowalagulila, kwaviya muhe wa ugoni uwagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:12">wamuleka Mulungu wawo.<verse eid="HOS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Wolava nhambiko kuchanyha ya milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">na wolava nhambiko kuna ivilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">hasi ya mibiki ya migude na mipela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">kwaviya mbeho zake zinoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">Ivo wandele wenu wotenda ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:13">na mwali wenu yosoligwa kotenda ugoni.<verse eid="HOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />Wanenu wa chike wahatenda ugoni sizawatagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">hebu wake wa wanenu wahatenda ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">kwaviya walume wenyewo wosondelela ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">na wotambika hamwe na malaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:14">Wanhu wano hawahulika ukweli wezanangigwa.<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />Mweye Waisilaili ingawa mutenda ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:15">sekemuwaleke wanhu wa Yuda watende uhasanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:15">Sekemuhite Giligali hebu Besi Aveni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:15">Sekemuilahe kwa kulonga, “Fana Mndewa Mulungu viyokala.”<verse eid="HOS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Waisilaili watatali fana vihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:16">lelo habali Mndewa Mulungu yawadime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:16">fana mwanang'hondolo kuna yamayani magalamu?<verse eid="HOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Waisilaili wailumba na nyang'hiti, waleke wagendelele.<verse eid="HOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Wahakomeleza kung'wa upele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:18">wohita kuzahila malaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:18">wolonda chinyala kufosa hishima yawo.<verse eid="HOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Beho kulu dizawapwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 4:19">na nhambiko zawo zizawaguma chinyala.<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ikwiza Isilaili na Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />“Mweye wakulu wa nhambiko, tegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:1">mweye Waisilaili, kingeni digutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:1">mweye wanhu wa kaye ya mfalume, tegelezeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:1">Mwizatagusigwa kwa kuwalanguliza wanhu kutali na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:1">kwaviya mukala fana mtego uko Misipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:1">na lwavu lutandigwe uko Taboli.<verse eid="HOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Wanhu wanilekile waiyoha kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:2">mbali niye Mulungu nizawatagusa wose.<verse eid="HOS 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Niwamanya Waisilaili kwa chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:3">habule chinhu chiwatendile kwa kunifisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:3">Kwaviya Waisilaili walamula kutambikila nyang'hiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:3">fana mwanamke malaya viyoibandama na mulume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:3">Wambula mwiko kumwangu.<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hosea kowazuma wanhu sekewatambikile milungu imwenga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />“Sang'hano zawo hazizawaleka wambwelele Mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:4">mizoyo yawo imema ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:4">hawanimanyile niye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />Magoda ya Waisilaili yowoneka funhu funhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:5">ivo Waisilaili woikwala kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:5">iviya wanhu wa Yuda woikwala hamwe nawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Wezahita na mabumbila yawo ya ng'hondolo na ng'ombe kumzahila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:6">mbali hawadaha kumpata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:6">kwaviya kainega nawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Wamtendela mbuli zihile Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:7">kwaviya weleka wana wa mmbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:7">lelo madugila yawo ya mwezi ukwima yezawananga hamwe na migunda yawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Isilaili woitowa na wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />“Toweni mhalati uko Gibea</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:8">na toweni mhalati uko Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:8">guteni nyangi uko Besi Aveni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:8">mweye wanhu wa Benyamini mwihi wenu kakuchisogo.<verse eid="HOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Muna isiku ya nhaguso, Isilaili izalekigwa fana matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:9">nigong'onda mbuli yondailawilile muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />Walangulizi wa Yuda walinga fana wanhu wokwesa mhaka za isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:10">nizawagidila ludoko lwangu fana mazi.<verse eid="HOS 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />Isilaili kagazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:11">na nhaguso yake imuhonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:11">kwaviya kailunga kusondelela ubozi.<verse eid="HOS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />Niye niwa fana sondo kwa wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:12">niwa fana mbiki wouwola kwa wanhu wa Yuda.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />Isilaili viyauwone utamu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:13">na Yuda viyachiwone chilonda chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:13">Isilaili kahita Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:13">kawatuma wanhu kwa mfalume mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:13">Mbali yeye hadahile kuwalagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:13">iviya hadaha kuwahonya vilonda vawo.<verse eid="HOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Kwaviya nizakuwa fana simba kwa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:14">nizakuwa fana mwanasimba mtatali muna ikaye ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:14">Nizawavavatula na kusegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:14">nizawagwila na habule munhu yondayawalopole.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />Nizabwela hanhu hangu mbaka vondawasame uhasanyi wawo na kuchizahila chihanga changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 5:15">wahawa muna uuzidilwa wezanizahila.”<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Kusama kwa uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />Wanhu wolonga, “Izoni chimbwelele Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:1">kwaviya yeye kachivavatula chipate vilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:1">mbali kezachihonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:1">yeye kachilumiza na iviya yeye kezaching'ha dawa ya vilonda vetu.<verse eid="HOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Zihafosa siku mbili kezachihonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:2">siku yeketatu kezachinula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:2">muladi chidahe kukala kuulongozi wake.<verse eid="HOS 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Chivimanye na chigendelele kummanya Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:3">Kulawilila kwake kwa kweli fana viya zuwa vidisomoza imitondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:3">Nayo kezachizila fana mvula za masika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:3">fana mvula za vuli vozitonya mwiisi.”<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:4">“Weye Isilaili, nikutendele choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:4">Weye Yuda, nikutendele choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:4">Ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo ulinga fana kungugu da imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:4">ulinga fana nhungwe yoisegela himahima.<verse eid="HOS 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />Ivo nimkanhani vihande vihande kwa milomo ya walotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:5">nimkomani kwa mulomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:5">nhaguso zangu zokwaka fana lumwemwe.<verse eid="HOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />Kwaviya nolonda ulondo wa kufunya umoyo siyo nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:6">na kummanya Mulungu kufosa nhambiko za kutimbula.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />Wabena Lagano fana Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:7">uko hawakalile waminika kumwangu.<verse eid="HOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Gileadi ni bululu da wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:8">bululu dihakigwa manha kwa ichimu cha ukomaji.<verse eid="HOS 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Fana viya wahokaji viwomsepa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:9">ivo niivo wakulu wa nhambiko viwaiting'hane hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:9">wawakoma wanhu muna inzila yoihita Shekemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:9">wotenda mbuli zihile ng'hani.<verse eid="HOS 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Muna ikaye ya Isilaili niwona mbuli ihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:10">uko watenda ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:10">Waisilaili wotendigwa wambule mwiko.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />Iviya weye Yuda, kwandikiligwa mavuno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 6:11">Baho vondaniwabweleze wafungwa wa wanhu wangu.”<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />“Vondanimuhonye Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:1">baho uhasanyi wa Isilaili wizagubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:1">na wihi wa Samalia nizaugubula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:1">Kwaviya wotenda uvwizi na wabavi wotula zikaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:1">na bumbila da wahokaji wobawa muna zinzila.<verse eid="HOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />Hawagesa kuwa nokumbuka sang'hano zawo zose zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:2">Uhasanyi wawo uwazunguluka banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:2">mbuli zihile zose ziwatendile za kuulongozi wangu.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />“Womtenda mfalume yadeng'helele kwa mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:3">iviya wawatenda walangulizi wawo wadeng'helele kwa uvwizi wawo.<verse eid="HOS 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Wose wagoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:4">Wawo walinga fana tanuli disomigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:4">diya msomaji hadikong'hele kwandusila viyobuluga usage mbaka vondaututumuke.<verse eid="HOS 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Siku ya dugila da mfalume wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:5">walangulizi waugula kwa upele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:5">nayo mfalume kailumba na wanhu wa kwiinzikila.<verse eid="HOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Mizoyo yawo iwa fana tanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:6">lusita viwokotela, ludoko lwawo lofuka yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:6">imitondo lokwaka fana moto woulava milambi.<verse eid="HOS 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Wose wapata moto fana tanuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:7">wowasoma watawala wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:7">wafalume wawo wose wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:7">na habule yonipula nimtaze.”<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wowahuwila wanhu wa zisi zimwenga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />Isilaili koihanganya na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:8">Isilaili kowoneka fana gate hadihinduligwe.<verse eid="HOS 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Manyambenyambe wamkomeleza nguvu zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:9">mbali yeye mwenyewo havimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:9">uhenga umema muna iditwi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:9">mbali yeye mwenyewo havimanyile.<verse eid="HOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Magoda ya Waisilaili yowalagusa wawo wenyewo, hawasama kumwangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:10">iviya hawanizahila kwa mbuli izo zose.<verse eid="HOS 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />Isilaili kawa fana nziwa mbozi yelibule nzewele, lusita kauko Misili kopula kutazigwa na lusita kauko Ashulu kopula kukalizigwa.<verse eid="HOS 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Vondawahite nizakwanzanza lwavu lwangu niwanamate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:12">nizawagwisa hasi fana ndege wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:12">nizawatagusa kwa mbuli zawo zowatendile.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />Wezagaya kwaviya wanikimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:13">wezanangigwa kwaviya wanilema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:13">Nolonda kuwakombola, ingawa walonga uvwizi kusonhela niye.<verse eid="HOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Hawanililila kulawa muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:14">mbali wolongelela muna yamakomwa yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:14">Woikanhakanha kuno womtambikila Baali muladi wapate ndiya na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:14">mbali wanileka niye.<verse eid="HOS 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />Niwafunza na niyagangamiza makono yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:15">mbali wanitendela mbuli zihile.<verse eid="HOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Woihindukila milungu yawo ya uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:16">wawo walinga fana upinde haufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:16">watawala wawo wezanangigwa kwa uzele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:16">kwa ichimu cha ulonzi wawo wa mdukula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 7:16">ivo wezazehigwa muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowalema Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />“Toweni mhalati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:1">mwihi kokwiza muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu fana masumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:1">kwaviya wanhu wadibena Lagano jangu, wayaleka malagilizo yangu.<verse eid="HOS 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Waisilaili wonililila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:2">‘Weye Mulungu wetu, chovimanya kuwa weye Mulungu wetu.’<verse eid="HOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />Mbali Waisilaili wazehula mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:3">ivo mwihi kezawasondelela.<verse eid="HOS 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />“Niye siwalongele wawasagule wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:4">waisagulila watawala waja niye siwamanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:4">waitendela nyang'hiti za milungu kwa hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:4">mbuli iyo yowananga.<verse eid="HOS 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />Mweye wanhu wa Samalia, noihila nyang'hiti yenu ya dang'ang'a.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:5">Nomuwonelani ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:5">vino mwizagendelela kuwa na uhasanyi mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="HOS 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Nyang'hiti ija ilawa Isilaili, isongoligwa na fundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:6">siyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:6">kweli nyang'hiti ya dang'ang'a ya Samalia izabenigwa vihande vihande.<verse eid="HOS 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />“Kwaviya wohanda mbeho, wezagobola vulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:7">mimeya yawo ya ngano yoikwima muna imigunda, haizalava ngano yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:7">na one yahema, ndiya yake izasoligwa na manyambenyambe.<verse eid="HOS 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />Waisilaili wameligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:8">sambi wahamwe na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:8">fana chia hachifaya.<verse eid="HOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Kwaviya wahita Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:9">fana chihongwe wa kumbago yeli yaidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:9">wawaliha hela watawala wa Ashulu muladi wawakalize.<verse eid="HOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Mbali ingawa watogola kuwaliha hela wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:10">nizawaduganya hamwe kuwatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:10">Mfalume mkulu wa Ashulu kezawatenda wagaye ng'hani.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />“Ingawa wanhu wa Isilaili wazenga chila lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:11">chila lupango lwawo luwa hanhu ha kutendela uhasanyi.<verse eid="HOS 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Niwandikila malagilizo yangu miyanza mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:12">mbali wayatenda fana hawayamanyile.<verse eid="HOS 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Wonilavila nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:13">na woja nyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:13">mbali niye Mndewa Mulungu sinogelwa nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:13">Nizazikumbuka mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:13">na nizawatagusa kwa uhasanyi wawo uwatendile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:13">Maabaho wezabwela Misili.<verse eid="HOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Kwaviya Waisilaili wamzimiza ija Yawalumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:14">waizengela kaye ya chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:14">na wanhu wa Yuda wongeza mabululu yeli na mhongono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 8:14">mbali niye nizayagalila moto mabululu yayo, iviya nizazitimbula mhongono zawo.”<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wotagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Mweye Waisilaili, sekemusekelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:1">sekemutende madugila fana zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:1">muwa wazinzi kwaviya muleka kumtegeleza Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:1">mudeng'helela yombe da ugoni kwa chila hanhu ha kubigila ndiya.<verse eid="HOS 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Mbali ngano na nongo za divai havizamulisani, hamwizapata divai ya sambi.<verse eid="HOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Hamwizakala muna iisi ya Mndewa Mulungu, mbali mweye Waisilaili mwizabwela Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:3">na mwizakuja ndiya yambule mwiko uko Ashulu.<verse eid="HOS 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Hamwizamgidila Mndewa Mulungu nhosa ya divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:4">na nhambiko zenu hazizamnogeza Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:4">Nhambiko fana izo zizakuwa fana ndiya ya matanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:4">wanhu wose woja ndiya iyo wokwambula mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:4">izakuwa ndiya ya kwigutiza muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:4">haizakwingila muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Vino mwizatenda choni muna didugila dipangigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:5">na muna didugila da Mndewa Mulungu? Hamwizadaha.<verse eid="HOS 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Vondamukimbile ng'hondo muna iisi yenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:6">Misili izamkunzagizani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:6">na mwizawandigwa muna dibululu da Memfisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:6">ngama zenu za hela zizaminyigwa na miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:6">miwa izamema muna yamahema yenu.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />Siku za kutagusigwa zifika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:7">siku za kulihiliza chisasi zahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:7">Waisilaili molondeka mulumanye lusita ulwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:7">mweye molonga, “Mulotezi mbozi kolangulizigwa na muhe wa umbunye.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:7">Mweye molonga ivo kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:7">kwa ichimu cha ludoko lwenu lukulu ng'hani.<verse eid="HOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Mulotezi kakala mkalizi wa Isilaili hamwe na Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:8">mbali mitego yomgozela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:8">na kutibusa kwamuna Ikaye ya Mulungu wake.<verse eid="HOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />Mwingila muna uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:9">fana muna zisiku za Gibea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:9">Mulungu kezakumbuka mbuli zenu zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:9">na kezamtagusani kwa uhasanyi wenu.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">“Viniwafikile Waisilaili, wakala fana zabibu muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">viniwawonile wasaho zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">wakala wanhu goya fana nhini za mwanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">mbali viwafikile kuja Baali Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">wasagula kumtambikila Baali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:10">watibusa fana chinhu chiya chowachilondile.<verse eid="HOS 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Ukulu wa Isilaili wizasegela fana ndege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:11">wana hawezakwelekigwa kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:11">hakwizakuwa na wana wa kwelekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:11">na hakwizakuwa na wimo.<verse eid="HOS 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />One waheleka wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:12">nizawahoka wana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:12">hezasigala hata imwe, kwaviya wezagaya vondanisegele na kuwaleka.<verse eid="HOS 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Nimuwona Isilaili kalinga fana mtende mdodo kuna iisi inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:13">Mbali sambi Isilaili kezawalongoza wanage wakachinjigwe.”<verse eid="HOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, vino wanhu wano kwizaweng'ha choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:14">Vino kwizawatagusaze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:14">Uwatende wake zawo sekeweleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:14">uwatende wapuwe matombo ya kong'heza wana wawo.<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />Kwaviya mbuli zawo zihile zowatendile zandusila Giligali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:15">uko niuko nyanduse kuwehila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:15">Kwa ichimu cha sang'hano zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:15">nizawawinga muna ikaye yangu na sizawalonda kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:15">walangulizi wawo wose wanileka.<verse eid="HOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Wanhu wa Isilaili watowigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:16">wawa fana mbiki unyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:16">haweleke wana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:16">One waheleka wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:16">nizawakoma wana wawo wowalonda.<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Mulungu wangu kezawalema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:17">kwaviya walema kumtegeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 9:17">Ivo wezawegela muna izisi zimwenga.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wohasanya na wotekigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Waisilaili wakala fana mzabibu unogile, mzabibu ukwima matunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:1">Matunda viyaiyohile kongezeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:1">ivo viwaiyohile kuizengela chila lupango lwa mulungu Baali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:1">viya isi yawo viiyohile kunogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:1">ivo viwaiyohile kuhamba mhanda za nhambiko.<verse eid="HOS 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Mizoyo yawo imema uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:2">lelo wezatagusigwa kwa ubananzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:2">Mndewa Mulungu kezabomola chila lupango lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:2">na kezazinanga mhanda zawo za nhambiko.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />Maabaho wezalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:3">chabule kaidi mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:3">kwaviya hachimdumbile Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:3">Mbali hata one chihawile na mfalume yahachitendele choni?<verse eid="HOS 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Wolonga mbuli za chakachaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:4">viwoilagana woilaha uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:4">wanhu woilongeleza kuna ichitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:4">walinga fana savu dili na sumu kumgunda.<verse eid="HOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Wakaya wa Samalia wezagudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:5">kwa ichimu cha nyang'hiti ya dang'ang'a da kuja Besi Aveni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:5">Wanhu wake wodililila dang'ang'a diya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:5">mbaka wakulu wa nhambiko woditambikila wodililila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:5">kwaviya ukulu wa dang'ang'a diya usegezigwa.<verse eid="HOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />Nyang'hiti iyo izagaligwa Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:6">fana chitumetume kwa mfalume mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:6">wanhu wa Isilaili wezagumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:6">wezaiwonela chinyala nyang'hiti yawo.<verse eid="HOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Mfalume wa Samalia kezakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:7">fana hovu muna yamazi.<verse eid="HOS 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />Chila lupango lwa uhasanyi uko Aveni lwizabomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:8">hanhu haja Waisilaili howatendile uhasanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:8">Miwa na mbigili vizakota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:8">na kugubika chila lupango lwawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:8">Maabaho wezailongela milima, “Chigubikeni!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:8">na vilima “Chilagalileni!”<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu koilaha kuwatagusa Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />Mweye Waisilaili, mutenda uhasanyi kwandusila uko Gibea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:9">na musigala uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:9">Kweli ng'hondo izamnangani mweye mutenda mbuli zihile uko Gibea.<verse eid="HOS 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />Lusita lonilonda, nizamtagusani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:10">wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezaiting'hana kumkomani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:10">na wezamtendani mweye Waisilaili muwe watumwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:10">kwa ichimu cha mbuli mbili zimuhasanye.<verse eid="HOS 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Isilaili kalinga fana dang'ang'a difundizigwe vinogile, kalonda kubeta ngano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:11">Mbali singo yake inogile nizaifunga kongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:11">Yuda kezalima kwa gembe yeye mwenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:11">Yakobo kezabulula gembe da kuhalilila.<verse eid="HOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />Ihandileni unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:12">goboleni ulondo wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:12">limeni migunda ilekigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:12">kwaviya lusita lwa kumzahila Mndewa Mulungu lufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:12">muladi yamgalileni unovu fana mvula.<verse eid="HOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />Mbali mweye muhanda wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:13">na mugobola ubamanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:13">muja matunda ya uvwizi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:13">kwaviya muhuwila nguvu zenu wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:13">na wingi wa watowang'hondo wako.<verse eid="HOS 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />Ivo wanhu wako wezapata tibwilitibwili da ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:14">mhongono zako zizabomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:14">fana viya mfalume Shalimani viyawanangile wanhu wa Besi Alibeli kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:14">na china mama viwabeneke hamwe na wanawo.<verse eid="HOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Mweye wanhu wa Beseli, mbuli ino izamulawililani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:15">kwaviya muna wihi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 10:15">kwahakunguzuka mfalume wa Isilaili kezakomigwa.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowawonela ubazi Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />“Isilaili viyakalile mwana, nimulonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:1">Kulawa Misili nimtanga mwanangu.<verse eid="HOS 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Mbali vinigendelele kuwatanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:2">ivo waiyohile kuhita kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:2">wagendelela kuwatambikila Mabaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:2">na wazisomela ubani nyang'hiti za milungu yawo.<verse eid="HOS 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Niwafunza wanhu wa Isilaili kugenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:3">niwasola muna yamakono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:3">mbali hawavimanyile kuwa niye iyo niwalolese.<verse eid="HOS 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Niwalanguliza kwa uhole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:4">niilumba nawo kwa ulondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:4">fana tata viyomwinula mwana mbaka kuna yamakanza yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:4">niivo viniwatendele wawo, niidulika na niwang'wiza.<verse eid="HOS 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />“Lelo wezabwela muna iisi ya Misili na wezagwiligwa na mfalume wa Ashulu, kwaviya hawasamile kumwangu.<verse eid="HOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Panga dizakwiza muna yamabululu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:6">dizabena mhalaligwe za nyivi za mabululu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:6">na kuyananga malungilo yawo.<verse eid="HOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Wanhu wangu wailunga kunileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:7">womtanga mulungu Baali yawataze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:7">mbali hadaha kuwenula.<verse eid="HOS 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />Weye Isilaili, nodahaze kukuleka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:8">Weye Isilaili, nodahaze kukwasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:8">Nizadahaze kukutenda fana bululu da Adima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:8">Nizadahaze kukutenda fana bululu da Seboimu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:8">Moyo wangu uhinduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:8">noiyoha kuwona ubazi.<verse eid="HOS 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Nizalukimilila ludoko lwangu lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:9">sizawananga kaidi Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:9">kwaviya niye Mulungu siyo munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:9">niye niiyo Yelile vimwili na sizakwiza kwa ludoko.<verse eid="HOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />Wezanisondelela niye Mndewa Mulungu yonitongoloma fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:10">vondanitongolome wezanizila kulawa uhelelo wa zuwa kuno wogudemeka.<verse eid="HOS 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Wezakwiza kulawa Misili kuno wogudemeka fana ndege,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:11">wezazumha kulawa Ashulu fana huwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:11">niye nizawabweleza kumwawo.” Mbuli ino ilawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wohasanya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Wanhu wa Isilaili wogendelela kunivwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:12">na wanhu wa Yuda wovwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 11:12">mbali wanhu wa isi ya Yuda wang'hali waminika na womtambikila Mulungu Yelile.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />Wanhu wa Isilaili wotenda ubozi kwa kuilisa beho na kuilumba na beho da ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:1">wokongeza uvwizi na unanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:1">wotenda lagano na Waashuli, mavuta yogaligwa Misili.<verse eid="HOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kana mbuli na wanhu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:2">kezamtagusa Yakobo kwa mbuli ziyatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:2">na kezamuliha kwa sang'hano yake.<verse eid="HOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />Yakobo viyakalile mmunda kamha chisiginho cha sekulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:3">viyawile mkulu kaihuma na Mulungu.<verse eid="HOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />Yakobo kaihuma na msenga wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:4">Yakobo kamuhuma, mbali kalila na kampula msenga iyo yamtemele mate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:4">Mulungu kamwizila Yakobo uko Beseli na kalonga nayo.<verse eid="HOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:5">Mndewa Mulungu niijo zina jake!<verse eid="HOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Mumbwelele Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:6">muwe na ulondo wa kufunya umoyo na mutende viya voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:6">muhuwileni yeye siku zose.<verse eid="HOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />Mchuuzi kosang'hanila ningo za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:7">kolonda ng'hani kubamanya wanhu.<verse eid="HOS 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Isilaili kalonga, “Niye nina vinhu vingi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:8">niye nina chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:8">na sihasanya mbee.”<verse eid="HOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />“Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:9">nikulavile kuna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:9">nizakutenda ukale muna dihema kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:9">fana viutenda muna yamadugila ya vibanda.<verse eid="HOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Nilonga na walotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:10">nyongeza malaguso mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:10">nisang'hanila masimwe kufosela walotezi.”<verse eid="HOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Vino uko Gileadi kuna wihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:11">Wanhu wake hawafaya chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:11">Vino hawalava nhambiko za kutimbula uko Giligali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:11">Chila mbahasha yawo ilinga fana mbahasha za mabwe muna umgunda ulimigwe.<verse eid="HOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />Yakobo kakimbilila muna iisi ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:12">kasang'hanila muladi yapate muke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:12">kadima ng'hondolo muladi yapate muke.<verse eid="HOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kamsang'hanila mulotezi kuwalava Waisilaili Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:13">kwa walotezi kaweka goya.<verse eid="HOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Wanhu wa Isilaili wamguma ludoko ng'hani Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:14">Mndewa Mulungu kezawalihiliza yehile yawo yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 12:14">kezawatagusa kwa mbuli zihile ziwatendile.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Nhaguso kusonhela Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Wanhu wa kabila da Efulaimu viwalongile, kukala na gudemeko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:1">watogozigwa umo Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:1">mbali watenda uhasanyi kwa kumtambikila mulungu Baali na wadanganika.<verse eid="HOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Wanhu wa kabila da Efulaimu waiyoha kutenda uhasanyi, waitendela nyang'hiti za chuma kwa nzewele zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:2">nyang'hiti za hela zitendigwe vinogile ng'hani, zose zitendigwa na mafundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:2">yolongigwa kusonhela wanhu wano, “Wolava nhambiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:2">na wononela nyang'hiti za madang'ang'a!”<verse eid="HOS 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Lelo wanhu wawo wezakuwa fana kungugu da imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:3">hebu fana nhungwe yoisegela himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:3">fana viya makang'ha viyohembelusigwa hanhu ha kubetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:3">na fana yosi vodilawa muna dibomba.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />Mbali niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:4">yonimulavileni muna iisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:4">Muvimanye kuwa habule Mulungu imwenga mbali niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:4">Iviya habule mulopozi imwenga mbali niye.<verse eid="HOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />Nimulolani goya vomukalile kwiichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:5">muna iisi ili na ng'hangu.<verse eid="HOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />Vinimwing'hileni ndiya, muja na mwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:6">muwa na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:6">lekamana munizimiza.<verse eid="HOS 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Lelo nizakuwa fana simba kumwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:7">nizamsepani fana duma muna inzila.<verse eid="HOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Nizamzumhilani fana dubu yahokigwe wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:8">na nizamvavatulani mhambaga zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:8">Uko nizamjani fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:8">nizamvavatulani fana mnyama mkali.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />Weye Isilaili, kunangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:9">kwaviya weye huli ubanzi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:9">huli ubanzi wa mtazi wako.<verse eid="HOS 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Lelo mfalume wako kakulihi yondayakukombole muna yamabululu yako yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:10">Walamuzi wako wouwalongile vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:10">“Ning'heni wafalume na watawala.”<verse eid="HOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />Nikwing'ha mfalume vinikalile na ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:11">nimsegeza kwa ng'hasiliki yangu.<verse eid="HOS 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />Uhasanyi wa wanhu wa Isilaili wikigwa ngama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:12">uhasanyi wawo wikigwa goya kwa kwandikigwa.<verse eid="HOS 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Kezapata usungu fana wa muke yolumwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:13">mbali yeye ni mwana yeli mbozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:13">kwaviya lusita lufika mwana kokalama kulawa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:13">muna umunda wa mami yake.<verse eid="HOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />Vino nolondeka niwakombole wanhu wano kulawa kuzimu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:14">Vino nolondeka niwakombole wanhu wano kulawa kwiifa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:14">Weye ifa ugale nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:14">weye kuzimu ugale kunanga kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:14">Sizawawonela ubazi kaidi.<verse eid="HOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />One Isilaili yahatelela fana mayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:15">niye Mndewa Mulungu nizagala beho kulu da ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:15">beho dondadilawe kuchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:15">iviya masima na nzasa zizanyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:15">Dungu jake dizasoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:15">hamwe na ngama zake zose.<verse eid="HOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />Wanhu wa Samalia wezatagusigwa kwa mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:16">kwaviya wamulema Mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:16">wezakomigwa kwa mazele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:16">iviya wana wawo wezahondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 13:16">wanaake weli na wimo wezatumbuligwa.<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Kusama muladi kutemeligwa mate</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Mweye Waisilaili, mbweleleni Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:1">kwaviya muikwala kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu.<verse eid="HOS 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />Mbweleleni Mndewa Mulungu na mumulongele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:2">“Uchilekelele uhasanyi wetu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:2">na uhokele vinhu vetu vinogile muladi chikutogoze weye fana viya chihalavile nhambiko ya ng'ombe.<verse eid="HOS 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Ashulu haizachikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:3">hachizahuwila kaidi falasi wa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:3">hachizalonga kaidi, ‘Milungu yetu’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:3">nyang'hiti zochisongole wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:3">kwaviya weye kowawonela ubazi wachiwa.”<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizawatenda wanhu wangu wanibwelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:4">nizawalonda kaidi kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:4">kwaviya ludoko lwangu lumala kumwawo.<verse eid="HOS 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Nizakuwa fana nhungwe kwa Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:5">nawo wezakwalika fana maluwa yayungiyungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:5">wezakuwa na mazizi fana mibiki ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="HOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />Matambi yake yezakwanzanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:6">unovu wake wizakuwa fana mbiki wa mzaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:6">mnung'ho wake unoga fana mbiki wa Lebanoni.<verse eid="HOS 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Wawo wose wokala hasi ya sisila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:7">wezazilibuka fana ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:7">Wezabwela na nizawakaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:7">wezakwalika maluwa fana mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:7">mnung'ho wake wizakuwa fana mnung'ho wa divai ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="HOS 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Mweye Waisilaili, vino nyang'hiti za milungu zomtazani choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:8">Niye notegeleza mbuli zenu zomupula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:8">Niye nilinga fana mbiki uli na mayani mabisi siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:8">mwizapata matunda yenu kulawa kumwangu.”<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Mweye wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:9">munhu yeli na ubala yavimanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:9">kuwa nzila ya Mndewa Mulungu igoloka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:9">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile woisondelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HOS 14:9">mbali wahasanyi woikwala umo.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>